===[[Pokémon Masters EX]]===
{{main|Anabel (Masters)}}
Anabel, in her [[Alola]]-based design, forms a [[sync pair]] with {{p|Snorlax}} in [[Pokémon Masters EX]]. Her Snorlax is capable of [[Gigantamax]]ing. Anabel became a playable sync pair on February 15, 2023.

Anabel first appeared as an NPC during the [[Kalos]] chapter of the [[villain arc]]. She also made notable appearances later in the villain arc.

